  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue Mediterranean Partnership Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mediterranean Sea basin is a significant marine biodiversity hotspot and a vital resource of economic activities for countries in the region. The fund promotes the transition to a sustainable blue economy in the Mediterranean region by financing ambitious projects, for example by supporting initiatives in the areas of sustainable water management, maritime energy management, biosphere protection and waste management. International financial institutions, development partners and public and private actors in the region will be encouraged to prioritize investments in the sustainable blue economy. It also aims to strengthen the dialog between stakeholders and promote the regional coordination of partnerships to pool resources.</narrative>
  </description>
